// lib/rota-translations.ts
//
// Translations for the prosopocracy.com ROTA subpage (/rota).
// Same conventions as lib/homepage-translations.ts:
// - "ROTA" and "Horistics" stay as-is in every language (proper nouns).
// - Greek epigraph quotes are NOT included here (this page has none —
//   its quotes, e.g. "Demos kratos", are already translated per-language
//   since they're presented as English/Greek transliteration, not native
//   Greek script, in the source pages).
// - dialCenterWord1 / dialCenterWord2 are the two-line label in the center
//   of the rotation diagram (EN: "ONE" / "CITIZEN", EL translated it to
//   "ΕΝΑΣ" / "ΠΟΛΙΤΗΣ" — so this is translated per language, not fixed).
//
// STATUS: ROTA COMPLETE — all 40 languages done (en, el, es, pt, it, fr, de,
// nl, da, no, sv, fi, is, et, lv, lt, pl, cs, sk, hu, sl, ro, sr, hr, bg, sq,
// uk, ru, ka, tr, ja, ko, zh, hi, ms, id, tl, he, ar, fa).
// Homepage and ROTA are now both fully translated into all 40 languages,
// and every homepage's "Read the ROTA proposal" link points to that
// language's own real ROTA page — no more falling back to English.

